n someone  ends up pushing the wrong buttons and  the powerful charmy comes out you don't  get recognized as a magic knight for  nothing and charming won't hesitate to  demonstrate to anyone who dares to get  between her and her food she makes such  good use of her obsession with food in  combat and her food magic as well as the  new form that comes with it is truly a  sight to behold this little girl betrays  expectations like no other and that's  why she finds herself on this list  the pursuit of strength however isn't  limited to these characters like them  you can be this unassuming guy who turns  out to be a master of clans and strategy  under your command new legends will be  born in this eye-catching rpg and the  sponsors of this video bloodline heroes  of lithus just when you thought you'd  seen it all in the world of mobile rpgs  here comes this contender giving the  genre a new spin bloodline heroes of  litas is a card based rpg that features  spectacularly realistic 3d graphics  bringing in western aesthetics with some  of the most fluid controls fighting and  collecting are some of the most  important parts in an action rpg but  what i really like about bloodline  heroes of lethal is that it takes the  customization aspect that rpgs are  lorded for that makes it such an  integral part of the gameplay this is a  game where part of mastering it involves  marrying bloodlines mixing and matching  in order to create the perfect champion  so whether you're on android or ios feel  free to try this game out right now you  can also scan the qr code in order to  know more about the game trying the game  out is fun but it gets even more fun if  you get started with a whole bag of  treasures so if you're up for more  rewards you can use my link in the  description to obtain a champion token  and a hundred thousand gold and that's  not all you also get 100 diamonds to  help kickstart your journey  bonji is up next  ah ranking of kings it's one of the best  anime to come out in recent memory it's  one hell of an underdog story starring  the plucky budgie it's not hard to see  why the story beats are like that just  look at the harmless guy there's no  question that bonji's the weakest  character in the series at the start  he's got zero combat affinity no  physical strength oh and there's the  hearing disability to cap it all off as  well but as the characters in the story  eventually learn there's nothing more  dangerous than to underestimate this  determined boy after all what he lacks  in strength he makes up for in his  insane agility eventually he gets better  and with despair's help he starts  learning the ins and outs of combat  becoming one of the most cerebral  fighters as the show progresses it takes  immense will to not only be unhampered  by physical disabilities but also make  the most out of circumstance and rise up  to prove everyone wrong ranking of kings  is such an inspirational story and you'd  be missing out by not watching it  biscuits a surprisingly strong mentor  [Music]  there are a lot of easygoing mentor  characters in anime those who take  things in their stride before showing  how powerful they are like gojo or  kakashi then there are those grizzled  all men like natero in contrast a  literal lolly like biscuit doesn't have  as strong of a first impression or  potential until she reveals her true  form things then turn scary biscuit's  true form has her put a complete 180  from her initial appearance and that  muscular form ought to give anyone  nightmares perfect for her training  sessions that feel straight from hell  biscuit's a very very powerful character  you won't be able to tell by just  looking at the girl who looks like she  belongs in some other genre and if  you're looking for someone to train you  she's one of the best and toughest  teachers you can ever get  if you were to pick someone to have you  back from the seven deadly sins the task  is quite easy you'd either go for the  main guy 